      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia nyina Ahazia kayaboine okwo omutabani yafa, asilikya oruganda rw'omukama rwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yehoshebu muhara w'Omukama Yoramu, niwe munyanya Ahazia, akwata Yoashi mutabani wa Ahazia, amwihya omu bana b'omukama ababaire nibaija kwitwa, amutwara n'omuleziwe amuta omu kitabo. Aba nikwo amusheleka atyo Atalia, aha rw'ekyo tiyaisirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi akaikara na Yehosheba, beshelekire omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama emyaka mukaga, orwo Atalia yabaire ali mutwazi w'ensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omu mwaka gwa mushanju, Yehoyada omukuhani, atuma abakuru b'abalinzi b'omukama n'ab'ekikaare kumushanga Rwensinga y'Omukama, mwonene omwo akora nabo endagano ashuba abanahiza, aboleka n'omwana w'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaragira ati, “Ekyo murakora niky'eki: Etheluti yanyu eraijaga aha mulimo ahali Sabato, balinde ekikaare ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etheluti ya kashatu egye aha kihigi kya Suri kandi etheluti ya kashatu egye aha kihigi enyuma y'abalinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebichweka byanyu ebyo byombili, abalikuragirwa kwija aha mulimo ahali Sabato, barata kulinda Rwensinga y'Omukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bazingore omukama, buli omoi ashangwe akwete ebikwato. Wena wena arayenda kubatahamu mumwite. Mushembe omukama orwo alikuturuka n'okugaruka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru b'eihe bakora nk'okwo Yehoyada omukuhani yaragira. Aha kiro kya Sabato bamugoba, buli omoi amuletera abantube ab'okugya aha zamu y'okulinda, bakaihyangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuhani akwasa abakuru b'eihe amachumu n'engabo eby'Omukama Daudi yasigire, bikaba bibiikirwe omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalinzi bona bemelera bakwata ebikwato by'endashana, kwema rubaju orwa kasi orwa Rwensinga kuhika rubaju orwa bikara, bazingora ealutare na Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yehoyada ashohoza omwana w'omukama, amujweka orukinga, amukwasa ekitabo ky'Amateka g'obukama, bamuranga okwo yaba Mukama, bamukora amajuta, batera n'enganga bagamba bati, “Omukama nakamelere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia kayahuliire empundwi z'abalinzi n'abantu, abahondera Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugya kunaga amaisho abona omukama ayemeleire aha nyomyo nk'okwo omuchwo gwabaire guli, abakuru b'eihe n'abatezi b'amakondere bamuli aha rubaju, abanyansi bona nibeshanda nibatagya amakondere. Atalia atagura enyambarwaze akunga ati, “Mwanshenga! Mwanshenga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo Yehoyada omukuhani yaragiire abakuru b'eihe kumurabya omu njuru z'abaisherukare bakamuturukya; kandi abagambira kwita kaishe muntu aramuhondera. Yehoyada akanga kumwitira Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo bamukwata, bamurabya omu Kihigi ky'Efarasi, bamugobya omu kikaare baba nimwo bamwitira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akwata omukama n'abantu abakoza endagano n'Omukama Ruhanga okwo baraba bantube, ashuba araganisa omukama n'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abanyansi bona bagenda rwensinga ya Baali bagikambura, ealutare n'ebishushanibye babyatayata. Matani omukuhani wa Baali bamwitira omu maisho ga ealutare ezo. Omukuhani ashuba ataho ab'okulinda Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwata abakuru b'eihe, abalinzi b'omukama n'ab'ekikaare, n'abanyansi bona baihya omukama omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama bamutwara omu kikaare, baletwa omu Kihigi ky'Abalinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abanyansi bona bashemelerwa n'ekigo kichulera kabamazire kwitira Atalia omu kikaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi kugya kutwara engoma akaba aina emyaka mushanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
